1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,556
The Car Trip by Ruth Donnelly we are going  on a trip
露丝·唐纳利的汽车旅行我们要去旅行

2
00:00:03,557 --> 00:00:04,557
Not on a plane!
不是在飞机上！

3
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:05,740
Not in a ship!
不是在船上！

4
00:00:05,918 --> 00:00:07,916
We will ride in our new car
我们将乘坐我们的新车

5
00:00:07,918 --> 00:00:09,900
Buckle up -- we will go far
系好安全带我们会走得更远

6
00:00:10,069 --> 00:00:11,589
Red light stop
红灯停止

7
00:00:11,718 --> 00:00:13,021
Green light, go
绿灯，走

8
00:00:13,198 --> 00:00:15,728
Yellow light means slow, slow slow
黄灯表示慢，慢，慢

9
00:00:15,757 --> 00:00:17,437
Baby brother starts to fret
小弟弟开始烦恼

10
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:19,481
Sister says,"Are we there yet?
姐姐说：“我们到了吗？

11
00:00:19,481 --> 00:00:19,878
"
"

12
00:00:19,878 --> 00:00:20,797
Quite now
相当现在

13
00:00:20,797 --> 00:00:21,957
Don't make a peep
别偷看

14
00:00:21,957 --> 00:00:23,780
Baby brother's  fast asleep
小弟弟睡着了

15
00:00:23,797 --> 00:00:24,957
I'm as quite as a mouse ...
我像老鼠一样安静…

16
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:27,442
And here we are --at Grandma's house！
我们到了——在奶奶家！

